{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q4198750","formula":"C₂₄H₄₀N₅O₈⁺","hill":"C24H40N5O8","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":24.0,"H":40.0,"N":5.0,"O":8.0},"names":{"en":"Isodesmosine","ru":"Изодесмозин"},"descriptions":{"en":"Isodesmosine is a lysine derivative found in elastin. Isodesmosine is an isomeric pyridinium-based amino acid resulting from the condensation of four lysine residues between elastin proteins by lysyl-oxidase. These represent ideal biomarkers for monitoring elastin turnover because these special cross-links are only found in mature elastin in mammals.","ru":"Изодесмозин — аминокислота, изомер десмозина, отличающаяся от него лишь расположением боковых цепей на пиридиновом кольце. Вместе с десмозином скрепляет нити эластина. В пептидных последовательностях обозначается Ide."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":13811,"mass":526.6,"charge":1,"smiles":"C1=C(C=[N+](C(=C1CCC(C(=O)O)N)CCCC(C(=O)O)N)CCCCC(C(=O)O)N)CCC(C(=O)O)N","inchikey":"RGXCTRIQQODGIZ-UHFFFAOYSA-O","iupac":"2-amino-6-[2-(4-amino-4-carboxybutyl)-3,5-bis(3-amino-3-carboxypropyl)pyridin-1-ium-1-yl]hexanoic acid","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"13811","atoms":77,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":1.959,"y":-0.757,"z":0.275,"el":"C"},{"x":1.329,"y":-1.815,"z":0.911,"el":"C"},{"x":0.153,"y":-1.561,"z":1.6,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.4,"y":-0.322,"z":1.664,"el":"N"},{"x":0.247,"y":0.759,"z":1.117,"el":"C"},{"x":1.425,"y":0.534,"z":0.348,"el":"C"},{"x":2.153,"y":1.633,"z":-0.418,"el":"C"},{"x":2.166,"y":1.383,"z":-1.937,"el":"C"},{"x":2.538,"y":2.615,"z":-2.778,"el":"C"},{"x":1.404,"y":3.651,"z":-2.743,"el":"C"},{"x":0.223,"y":3.406,"z":-2.937,"el":"O"},{"x":1.813,"y":4.895,"z":-2.414,"el":"O"},{"x":3.833,"y":3.185,"z":-2.344,"el":"N"},{"x":-0.262,"y":2.17,"z":1.339,"el":